# ============================================================================
#  Tax Strategy Planner — files that must never enter version control
#
#  The first block is the important one. This app's whole job is handling real
#  client return data, and it writes/reads that data as files that land in
#  THIS folder by default (Export Client File, Import Return (PDF)). A client
#  file committed here would put a named client's full return data into git
#  history permanently — a disclosure problem under IRC 7216 and the firm's
#  acceptable-use policy, and one that survives deleting the file later.
# ============================================================================

# Client data — exports from this app (see docs/client-file-format.md)
*.tsiq.json

# Client returns and any other client documents dropped in the folder
*.pdf
*.PDF
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls

# Generated client deliverables, if ever saved to disk rather than printed
*client-report*.html
*slideshow*.html
*pitch*.html

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Ordinary noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Node — only scripts/*.js run under Node; nothing here is needed at runtime,
# but a stray `npm install` while poking at the validator would drop this in.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*

# Scratch
tmp/
temp/
scratch/
*.bak
*.orig
